  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc9d2ddcadf26d6b515eef74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パパママに衣装見せたら、\r\nお遊戯会？の動画きたん！\r\nウチエグ笑っててガチ笑った☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4858a9e1a33a791532816832c151dc5c4e99d6d623ce10e327bf0c5f20e982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af98a1ea36e9c424d6fd6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お嬢の手エグちぃちゃい！かわち！\r\n…ってゆったら、道場行って\r\n秒で投げられた…強い…しゅき…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f22d798014904755e39e25818dc87c5643a7fa677221a4c085de68422c10988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c0f670b68e048a6ffd22ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ケイちゃんミラちゃんにさ、\r\n後ろからハグるっしょ？\r\n絶対フフって笑うん。超幸～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc4c3ebcfd57c33d7dc972a6be3a40ec173d0a225d1358b696bc712678ade0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240524c02477a089d7f311a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "っしゃー！今日も爆ワラ！\r\nか・ま・せー！…ってことで！\r\nとりま反省文パスってくる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b4d7a2b71db8e6dca0d87f78c9e4cc76f66808a53ba15f756e9716878afe59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e72077430b527f1a6952f69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴ！今日の放課後、暇んちゅ？\r\nプチドロワフェスっから、\r\n参加よろたの☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5628977d5313fd418d21c8f3007768ebb10f3ced37a559a618216cfe7c19dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aace34f7a83571d93e9f81d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん～あ！今日も鬼騒ぎまちた☆\r\nドロフェス楽しすぎな！\r\n反省文ってもよき丸水産☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "83e505223e72eec73c44da5295e228316bc5b009501ade8653609f8783826f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff4529b60fad208e1554f53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うあ～超春い～。\r\nゼファっちとか、そこら飛んでね？\r\nガチタンポポいし…あ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d36dbc6b5f0c716beb8d40c715800c0240bd7f8be260ff999b1cb1627c5978e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a58f89b22c0404fe326c690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴ～制汗剤ない？\r\nジャケ暑すぎてゼロった！\r\nかーぴーて♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edc9aadae7b1f5cef2233f82d0815fff04da56aeae436c23d04c6f00c0a2721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3a1019d3962c951bd763ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねね！バンちゃむしらん？ほら、\r\n最近イベ続きで鬼疲れっぽくて？\r\nハグって元気したげよーって☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d56668c23702d5cdaaacaac64bebb65aefb43f018c0b7d052ecd0ef82928e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feab2272713f3006e36c906c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬は朝シチ☆これガチな！\r\n一生オネム～で『ん゛』って顔\r\nしてんの！鬼かわちぃ♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab89b3714dd6f32a69266deebf604df7660c413ae913e982a7ef39080a2b4f68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6497d55500cba63c58c7bde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "てか踊るなら暗いとこ行かん？\r\n衣装ピカらせ隊長命令☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cdcfd671ee325c596bd435827749863a90e420555633950ab8d7dd187cbfcd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33446c2bf79b94a8b1ff358d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うにゃ～！鳩捕まらん！\r\nウチも帽子からバサりたい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe84216efb4aa858a6f9808e0fb92fd296a87cfe8700b1a89b7a6e8fa669b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07adc915ead8853acf5b853c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～总算能跑步了！\r\n我等不及了☆连上课时也一直在\r\n笔记本上画线，想象自己在跑步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "001140ea6aff31e8b19d7325f5f8e4700c835b635764791a0172c7c4eae3a0a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9592d720dd54de6f93eb76a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アゲていくよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51b437c5fa3b01e1ed384d22cbdd1db356529e9831fa9332bc4f373d28d7462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcdd9bff0bbd629683e67440",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟阿训的合照被狂按赞！\r\n在开始训练前PO一张新的吧。\r\n总之先比个倒V耶～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "449b88dd0fdcb21b900dfe0ad8d563b741e12518f05f6614b8270783141cdd17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef4b58f8f81e63698c34549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "找一百名选手来比模拟赛怎样！？\r\n把闸门和赛道都拓宽～\r\n不妙，这祭典也太嗨了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb59c2034a0d1a1e4283b43cff3f99bfa6fd06d7976054cea0d4794bc3a2b3f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0333fef6ce978ba6ab7b4807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训要一起跑吗？\r\n短距离应该还好吧！\r\n绝对会很嗨☆一起跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dad8619578237811b4848a122c8124375bab7c8eda091c542d16088c0eec0e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce6408bf5c1c2cb5d1b20e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员是让我嗨起来的专家，\r\n这点我很清楚～☆\r\n今天要用什么让我嗨起来！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "985159b62025a46558a65c5b8bc901b40b55fefbd77cac2824195069d34e47f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bdec1f9665e403c60a6f97b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，你有发现吗！？\r\n刚才放的那首，是DJ太阳神remix！\r\n……你听过了？我想也是～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bd2ce91be4335bcc48fd5961f270ac224a09874bb76815000bb96878f0e150c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa827a7249477b9cab9a407f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来想说要嗨一波嗨一辈子啦～\r\n但现在觉得如果有阿训在\r\n应该办得到。是一定要做到☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2fbe5f560b039fb5f9a6ff2d6fe91a01297a19370dc3a173b4b9c38491e2fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2596ceaf486d0277c5974579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海！祭典！烟火派对～！\r\n很嗨吧，全都想玩吧，\r\n超棒的对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7768b38d69aec299c328c075884be6c41cd46c0d322d5a181a7990a1df131e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0072254db537e662588a6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テンアゲ衣装着てっし？\r\nとりまEDMっとくか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0941f3e8787ad8558ffc31085f15ae83650bdf79142ce3a12a6ecad741fbfbe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c842ef9ea0ba6d33ec5e6e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねぇねぇ！準備体操！ダンスど？\r\nウマトックで鬼バズってたヤツ\r\nあんだけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb8047863cfcf056378af7f04c342c191f1c1bc090dabab43be4e0c9f3dfe00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ccef43083a72777bb2f0a45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴ～トレメ決まった！？\r\nんじゃ、はよいこヒアウィゴ☆\r\n…はい！エスコーぴっ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1577273b03118fdc6aef21efb0e1729b350e6954067dbad9d18b27eef136e16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc88e0e6bb56d7aea670b8d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気晴らしに踊らん？\r\nてかリフトしてみん！？\r\n鬼飛ばす自信、ありぴ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "088f83d559e128c4e0c4a6a5df43060bd216eeff03dbfcf124466651a96ad54d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcf32153538a91b6715e0022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たまにはシュっとした\r\nちゃんヘリもいいっしょ？\r\nウチもしゅきぴ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d244cfac4673ce4ec336fed1c20a9db9a762331f9b01e98d3a412bf513c468f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf53c0103c7ac64ed5263f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お悩みなう的な？なら一旦踊んべ！\r\nお手を拝借、チェケって1曲☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a3af63907c90ad40ee4f85959b1cd6e65d2d262ffb3876b69922a567f96e14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1899d48f04ada3cdc8823519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "難しいことわからんケド、ゆーて\r\nトレぴのリードは世界一だし？\r\n勝つしかアリエンティヌス☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "687ebdf015d0f63cb7982929acccddfa6a232b89ed592e6488f5ad2cffa3565f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b7e8291c71ca38a7918596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训果然最棒了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "14aa02739c70461e4346d36707e1bfa0198e507b37022b6e1201139423753373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4109bb2630465e9a36697e8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "3Q水产特雷森学园分店☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "16beb489c524a91c72eb92cdc446bbefab586f5be14e01c166d192ec86520d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b749e541bad2f99eea2862a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一生ウチと！シャルウィーフェス☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f673237661937d1c625d7dce6b348d7c9ce7f2c841d0aa3da9e0ee8c08304d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0a42c2880a08bea0815736",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴのリード、神超えて愛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18183a97e3de05fa34fbc2b1b7b0b111f07bacc79726c7bb47c25ffecf4423b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f3bd5cb886714f652ca0c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配って！　アゲて！　ぽぽぽぽーん☆\r\nアゲの果てまで行っちゃってーー！！　ウェーーイ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a35c21304f79abf47e2352497a4677a976a11674205c99d3651b97a4aeb13f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba11f94c7d8f2376d8a44097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とりまお疲れ～☆　てかアガりヤバ。フェス超えて\r\n宇宙じゃん。こりゃごほーびもヤバっしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab674df8b65595d676ee2d7cc8cbc208c5154e3dd1c788a79a29aa37f1bc6f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe99315c4a8eec1af98c416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉神嗨啊☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb9394b9a35f45afa8bc1ea12934d148b13ef61785b63b33fb30b4c674774a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b591b48da9ee57ac90dc7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不止很神，根本就是神了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6be47d62a82cb7ef78d8dd80d6783dbaa27255d001f4adfcf9489293b00d784e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a046650df6b3fe54365cace",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶！\r\n非大拓太阳神莫属啦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9757111c1467deb45f2ab2552c3bf929d434246c758e607d10acf6c6d691cfbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de2efad0c3c031d21d1a0f09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最＆棒＆超嗨！\r\n嗨一波尽情吵闹吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7acddc96adb472df7421784eeee8abdcd3776a19f46ad6eeb6e6f358fbed02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aedd6254d254901423f0e54c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，跟上我的节奏吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b197a3c75fd53520a73cbbb7714eff045a7b60a91746c7766afed1ae5ae2ad84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3ad3d00e5b64f2b0549c9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就交给成神之后的我吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f85d89a75948363b87f0b1c75db621db4c19971d23433fce65fe50d79f3e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e71239d41cc7912dc67c5cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パーティーはこれからっしょ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "977fb54c09873ee422a988029943894c626a10da09f0dc9526a7d0ca1cb2520f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c680ed3e721ee894d64f4951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇいうぇーい！イケヘリ爆誕☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e671275685ad3119a8359d1c650b002f0577e710b039fffd75d42a1e8008eb1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175324e171cfced538581ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なぁに暗い顔してんの！\r\n…とりまウチの手、取ってみ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a90ef6c9a0de198910de0ce1557574c0cd325e9ee32f174f5ba484ffb26d5551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab908d2636e75beeafb5de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダイタクヘリオス！\r\nシャルウィってこー☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbb0eb3e818405f2024596ddfdeb5f66a426cbfd8f38e541b105372fe781b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3b9196023c29164f729e74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起超越极限吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37ddc9dbc777cf671e5287a33f7b4d9ebec86b29981c289f9b097aa29d56c26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f538a664818b9766bbde5b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在，涡轮的\r\n引擎就能超越极限超完全燃烧！\r\n两个人在一起就无敌了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22ce29c71d6e0fc79ea4e561a197dbd6eaab1cd49d5a0a8e4bb08eae89d3241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c784a74256a3dd296e3f1e75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターボいってくる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c821d5783baa5f41f02a52e1119ca16b91469c293a42a03effcbe6e5b3adb51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ce92b8074ee71e4ca47c63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442daf8fac876602f60d9d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员陪着啊！\r\n涡轮就能开心奔跑！开心变强！\r\n然后开心拿下胜利呢！根本是最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f13d2a0937d1edec3cfcbb75ab3ff44d563324601ad48344916266accbef276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a22f1fd2a81e44ac0ad621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要训练员露出笑容啊，\r\n涡轮也会很高兴哦！\r\n一直在一起就有最强的开心啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d48c2db7a67e4b6b48faeb0113db6d5840d570ac294e659cc7b2d5563281fad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0462811517134e772d5f1eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断地捣麻糬，捣啊捣啊捣啊！\r\n就完成超厉害的麻糬了！\r\n可以拉得跟涡轮的身高差不多长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae0ca599ae19bda6bb064765ab834b340cd92123549de74ae2f1b9e8699ef37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca51f7f19f5616660d064e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有咖啡色或黑色太无趣了！所以\r\n我加了果冻、腌渍红姜和灯泡装饰，\r\n做成色彩缤纷的超甜巧克力啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9723d8e7d300bf0f7b96224525c00206dd8266366f17a45240a4e2a1b6074ed8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c235a4a3937e988a6711ccdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "送你这个最强的超苦巧克力！\r\n这是涡轮到处去找才总算找到的哦！\r\n是最适合成熟的训练员的口味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a7cf00b120b4f0c473d8352d756d982b8391a08c45734082376dd7167477aa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef98983b1c6268690eea0a6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绑在竹子上的签纸啊，\r\n五颜六色的很漂亮对吧！\r\n如果会闪闪发光的话就更棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a121c592d0ca0dcc6b3aa9284a6e3f71420cd8f5498f907efc90c3aad5dc9f7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096431f63512480422f3b3e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要给涡轮彩色的点心？\r\n还是要被涡轮涂成彩色的！？\r\n训练员选一个吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3354a261e7ff235c7fbaf479a68a8bdbff7ed71d3459989aa25fc2d2d1085a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6b2288451903f0b28a915ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灯饰很棒对吧！如果圣诞老人\r\n也把雪橇弄得亮晶晶的话，\r\n就更容易发现他了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ea5edd337285994da6183b5500d2f6b91832bba88a8eb2c4e2026bb525f811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b26a36153cefbe98024dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果没有收到圣诞老人的礼物\r\n就跟涡轮说吧！\r\n涡轮每年都有收到，可以分给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "223f515bfdbae12eda1aca6b54b156ee66959d1e4b0876d0db61a917916b343a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91c4ca1289202454567e1028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好强好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2975259f05b9c60ee50d1c1c3e6fbeae5ce338ad09640875c748005a4f1f5f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38c7b393ed9df2376b794110",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然涡轮很讨厌大扫除！\r\n但擦地板比赛会让人热血沸腾哦！\r\n我们都是在菱亚没注意时举办呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bae549a15ee40e0f290a60acfa26d4444a1ce1b7b51ca37450fd1c264aac7c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38495689ed90e608689d31f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐～！\r\n我们会举办派对对吧！?\r\n涡轮要吃点心！很多的点心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9691ff3ee69dcd157e019ead035b15d128a5a5b8911e0d02d52155538b06e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ecfbc3e710b839baf27ded4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮做了一部庆祝生日的影片哦！\r\n影片内容是涡轮发射七彩的光束，\r\n在天空写上「助你升日快乐」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cefa0b0d12fcd695b80ed88d87af8a52d33821b38e669930239182cd42dba00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88920d3029034cfc2df7b681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们家在吃生日蛋糕的时候啊！\r\n会用鲜奶油或巧克力米装饰上\r\n与涡轮岁数相同颜色的数量哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1556f4452d20d0b78c06e74b48ed2d26cdecefa04a5cfc376b6e446ac0e323e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe83c5e602eccb0e0bec1c14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮过生日了～！\r\n欸欸！我们来举办游戏大赛吧！\r\n边吃蛋糕边玩游戏到睡着为止！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f76f3b5ffc01c0a920c4f8e748f7e26278369025b9f40474b11e58966b52a8ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a473ec247ee72ec0ccf03a15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是公告！收到公告啰！\r\n我们快点去看看嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d00375468f7fa68b8a1bbefdd25142fd4f2ad79073afcf5b81e45e1178a97ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:431e63bbea5745b61ede9f75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了耶～！\r\n欸，快点打开啦！快点嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a99bdf82aebd4b28b0ba2718f43185fdebf57ed6be1f217146aebc6869b0d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a161616d5ff237c64c50b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了耶！\r\n记得要确实收下报酬哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a6f45ecfb162fc8d5bee21abfb0363fe9f218fe6434efca34910d823102cc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a223c2d54515609eb68e5f9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说活动好像开始了！\r\n训练员会参加对吧！对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "924564b84316448989ac1a514fb859687629941713a5f910dc9d2758b08e18ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f38259ffc04a2a405cc828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～！快点去参加活动嘛！\r\n涡轮已经等不及了啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70f234c6d4eef41ee70e3f91b157155961c206ec27173e1184ed17567549ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa62e3270fc6b2f4def0cf99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会这样～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf13967ecc09de42754a88f4ad55c5a6133b7fd238857fcf1887f299b60ab6ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bad2b8f965d908400cfa630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说那个叫做赛马娘名鉴？的东西\r\n等级好像提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8cce81f9dc346488e2bd6c53aa6e01452f80f5be9a486db0ea82aeac6e30d46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7f69addd6240346fb0f96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服で走るとね、そでの中に\r\nびゅーって風が入ってくるの！\r\nターボの、えあいんてーく、だぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c502dbf23a7a10487cbaa5fdb2aadba681a5e687b798b10d2276f234213da035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eff0b46718a9df9b5812390d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごはん食べるときはそでまくるぞ！\r\n色が増えちゃうからな！\r\nおかずのタレとかついちゃって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a110cf896b446993ae40380d98e750cf14745a6b2d9d0a0b0ac5b5c44f515c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46af163b6411f2de34c5a904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服だと、待ち合わせのとき、\r\nすぐ気づいてもらえるんだ！シュミ\r\nとジツエキを兼ねる、ってやつ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb55d4f31a787a4e2aee30bb08413dfda8fe1fbaa50c862348188fb81b389538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da09f838f9954e8cd8266e38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～还不错嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa869e6de5b692a2e75b7990979b5a5b5385e057c2b94751415ad1f943e0db7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d038166a0fa8a4f769e2b374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们是最强的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad8bbfba0eb294eb79e305a8fc66b9ee1484bab9ed3ff1650e36a5501faf4b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c600d22f3122e6bc03786b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会这样～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf13967ecc09de42754a88f4ad55c5a6133b7fd238857fcf1887f299b60ab6ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a12cb7b8a182299cc048268f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～还不错嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa869e6de5b692a2e75b7990979b5a5b5385e057c2b94751415ad1f943e0db7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48f0b79de2a7d87c28807ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像创下高分纪录了耶！高分纪录！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7adaa26830a6490894189cbe8885844bccd360dd2e215de6dca3aafbdcc38b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c0eac90cdccde75470834e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人爆速起跑啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63f8eb739efc6eb11ec5a4286b4b9688f58de4b6fd97f71237602ee6ea1bd991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4673130924ea25b1a50924c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "11"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
